    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/doctor-physician/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Doctor Physician theme is a modern, professional, and responsive solution designed for medical practitioners, doctors, physicians, healthcare clinics, hospitals, dental clinics, pediatricians, general practitioners, specialists, wellness centers, medical consultants, and healthcare service providers. Ideal for showcasing medical services, appointments, patient care, consultation details, health packages, treatment plans, and doctor profiles, the theme provides a visually appealing and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices. It includes sections for service highlights, testimonials, banners, and strategically placed Call to Action (CTA) buttons to engage patients effectively. Built with clean, optimized code, the theme allows easy customization of layouts, colors, and typography to reflect your clinic’s branding. Fully compatible with WooCommerce for appointment bookings and payments, Contact Form 7 for patient inquiries, and Jetpack for performance, security, and social media integration, the Doctor Physician theme offers a professional, SEO-friendly, and high-performing platform to grow your medical practice online."
    },
